      fix: run `saddle doctor --fix` (or saddle init) to make it the default: it sets harness = "codex" in .saddle/config.toml unless you set harness there yourself; or install Claude Code: npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code (https://claude.com/claude-code), then claude /login

